OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1784994478
OL,3,CSummer getaway running smoothly at
OL,4,CDover
OL,6,FTens of thousands of holidaymakers
OL,7,Fhave headed through Kent on their
OL,8,Fsummer holidays - with little to no
OL,9,Fdelays today. Conventional border
OL,10,Fchecks at the channel ports made for
OL,11,Fsmoother sailings for customers.
OL,12,FBosses say that's partly down to the
OL,13,FEU's new entry exit system biometric
OL,14,Fchecks NOT being implemented yet. Port
OL,15,Fof Dover's Chief Executive says while
OL,16,Fthe technology is ready for September
OL,17,F- they didn't want to risk any hiccups
OL,18,Fon their busiest weekend.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
