OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1784994478
OL,3,CSummer getaway running smoothly at
OL,4,CDover
OL,6,FCEO Doug Bannister told ITV Meridian
OL,7,F"We've started this summer cracking.
OL,8,FThe weather's been nice of course, the
OL,9,Fsailings have been great, but the
OL,10,Fperformance of people making it
OL,11,Fthrough the Port and onto the ferries
OL,12,Fhas been astounding. The French
OL,13,Fimmigration police (Police aux
OL,14,FFrontieres) have given us more than
OL,15,Fenough resources. They are out
OL,16,Fmanning, they're being flexible. Of
OL,17,Fcourse we installed some additional
OL,18,Fcapacity, about 20% more border
OL,19,Fcapacity, that seems to have helped.
OL,20,FBut everything has come together for
OL,21,Fan excellent journey through the Port
OL,22,Fof Dover."
OL,26,@vD@Gqr
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
