OL,3,CSummer getaway running smoothly at
OL,4,CDover
OL,6,FWe asked Mr Bannister if he had
OL,7,Fconcerns about longer queues once the
OL,8,Fnew entry exit system is put into
OL,9,Faction.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1784994478
OL,3,CSummer getaway running smoothly at
OL,4,CDover
OL,6,FHe told us "The checks that aren't in
OL,7,Fplace are the biometric controls for
OL,8,Ffor the car passengers. We are doing
OL,9,Fthem for coaches, we're doing them for
OL,10,Ftrucks, but for the cars no. That's
OL,11,Fdue to come in in September. We have
OL,12,Finvested #40 million in a purpose-
OL,13,Fbuilt facility in our western docks to
OL,14,Fensure that we can handle our peak car
OL,15,Fflows for the full registrations. We
OL,16,Fjust need the Technology to be in
OL,17,Fplace to allow us to activate it."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
