OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1784994478
OL,3,CSummer getaway running smoothly at
OL,4,CDover
OL,6,FWith the start of the peak summer
OL,7,Fseason set to bring millions of
OL,8,Fdrivers on to the roads, there have
OL,9,Fbeen concerns it may lead to traffic
OL,10,Fchaos at the Port of Dover. But so far
OL,11,Ftoday things have run smoothly.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
